            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After publication of the article [1], it has been brought to our attention that a funding acknowledgement has been omitted from the original article. The authors would like to include the following, &quot;The study was undertaken as part of the Target Malaria consortium, which receives core funding from the Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &amp; from the Open Philanthropy Project Fund, an advised fund of Silicon Valley Community Foundation.&quot;</AbstractText>
